  "scope_notes": "Small change restricted entirely to `src/ipc/capnp/protocol.cpp` within experimental multiprocess IPC handling.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Retains the same mutex and `loopRef()` approach from the previous version.",
  "card": "Ensures CapnpProtocol methods hold active references to the IPC event loop and guards loop creation and destruction with a mutex. In multiprocess serve mode, only the parent connection previously kept the loop alive, risking data races or crashes if other threads accessed the event loop during shutdown or before parent setup completed. The change introduces a thread-safe loopRef helper to maintain event loop references during protocol calls.",
